  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.</p> <p>• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.</p> <p>• Cut cauliflower into small florets. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-7a106d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine garlic aioli and a <br>drizzle of olive oil. <br>• In a second large bowl, combine panko <br>breadcrumbs, Nan’s special seasoning, <br>garlic &amp; herb seasoning, Parmesan cheese and <br>a good drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Toss a handful of cauliflower in the aioli until <br>well coated. Transfer to breadcrumb mixture<br>and toss to coat. Transfer to a lined oven tray, <br>then repeat with remaining cauliflower.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-949a0910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Spread cauliflower out in a single layer. Bake until golden, 20-25 minutes.</p> <p>• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into bite-sized chunks.</p> <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</p> <p>• When oil is hot, cook haloumi, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes.</p> <p>• Transfer to a plate lined with paper towel.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-9293c620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the cauliflower is baking, thinly slice apple<br>into wedges. <br>• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-31c98930.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Just before serving, in a third large bowl, <br>combine spinach &amp; rocket mix, cucumber, <br>apple and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and <br>olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-22626440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rocket salad between bowls.<br>• Top with Parmesan and herb crumbed <br>cauliflower, haloumi and any remaining crumbs left on <br>the oven tray.<br>• Drizzle over caesar dressing to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-84807250.jpg"
    }
  ]
